 <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: auto; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 30px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);">
      <h2 style="color: #cc0000;">⚠️ Suspicious Login Attempt Detected</h2>
      
      <p>Hello {{userName}},</p>

      <p style="color: #333;">
        We noticed a failed login attempt to your account from an unrecognized device or location:
      </p>

      <ul style="color: #555;">
        <li><strong>Time:</strong> {{attemptTime}}</li>
        <li><strong>IP Address:</strong> {{ipAddress}}</li>
        <li><strong>Location:</strong> {{location}}</li>
        <li><strong>Device:</strong> {{device}}</li>
      </ul>

      <p style="color: #333;">
        If this was <strong>you</strong>, you can ignore this message. However, if you didn't try to sign in, we recommend:
      </p>

      <ul style="color: #333;">
        <li>Changing your password immediately</li>
        <li>Enabling two-factor authentication (2FA)</li>
        <li>Reviewing your recent account activity</li>
      </ul>

      <p style="text-align: center; margin: 20px 0;">
        <a href="{{securityLink}}" style="background-color: #cc0000; color: #ffffff; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 4px; text-decoration: none;">Secure My Account</a>
      </p>

      <p style="color: #888;">If you need help, contact our support team.</p>
      <p style="margin-top: 30px;">Thanks, <br><strong>{{companyName}} Security Team</strong></p>
    </div>